# Cross-OS / relative path conversion

Before using any path or command, detect the path style in the prompt and the
executing environment (Windows / Git-Bash / WSL / Ubuntu / deployed Linux),
then convert the path accordingly and resolve relative paths to absolute.
Never reuse a path or command from a foreign environment verbatim, and do not
assume a command exists in one shell because it works in another.

Application runtime paths (laravel_main) must resolve via
`App\Providers\PathMapper::mapWebPath()` or its helpers only — never raw
`storage_path()` / `base_path()` / `database_path()` / `env('*_PATH')` /
ad-hoc concatenation. See §6 of the canonical spec.

